<title>USA: ILEX Oncology IPO priced at $12/shr.</title>
<headline>ILEX Oncology IPO priced at $12/shr.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ILEX Oncology Inc said Friday its 2.5 million share initial public offering was priced at $12 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to use a majority of the net proceeds to fund internal product development in cancer prevention compounds, expansion of its drug development capacity and capabilities, and expansion of its portfolio of compounds.</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers was the lead manager and Cowen &amp; Co and Smith Barney were co-managers of the offering.</p>
</text>
